ang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">박사 과정 및 연구과정 등 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학사과정의 경우 기수혜자만 지원연장 가능 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학 기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">프로그램에 따라 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 6</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개월 또는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개월</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수학 대학 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: webpage </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참조</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(<a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.istruzione.it/web/universita/home\">http://www.istruzione.it/web/universita/home</a>)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>선발 방법</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국립국제교육원에서는 장학생 선발을 안내하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학생 선발은 이탈이아 정부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주한이탈리아문화원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">와 수학대학에서 결정</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학금 수혜 조건 등 기타 세부 사항 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: [</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">붙임</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-te